      <h2>What do you want to create?</h2>
      <p> A portfolio could mean a handful of things, including: </p>

        <ul>
          <li>A large case for contents of papers</li>
          <li>A range of investments held by an organization</li>
          <li>A collection of work</li>
        </ul>

      <p>For the purposes of this website and yourself, we will define a portfolio as <b>a collection of work and accolades, described to visually represent and communicate ones skills and experience.</b> What we look to accomplish is providing the knowledge and resources to create your own portfolio to stand out in competitive job markets.</p> 

      <p>A portfolio benefits from being designed with a certain <ins>theme</ins>, especially one that represents you well. A portfolios theme may consist of graphical elements such as color, typography, alignment, and more. It may also vary on the kind of work you would like to present.</p>

      <p>To get started, feel free to design your own template, or choose from one of out pre-set templates that suit you and your work best!</p>

